{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o066b","title":"立郭氏皇后赐爵赈谷","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o066b-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"立郭氏皇后赐爵赈谷","evidence":["mingdi-e-o066b-q"]},{"id":"houfei-e-o050a-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"帝疾困：明帝病困立郭氏为皇后","evidence":["houfei-e-o050a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0054","role":"受立","evidence":["mingdi-e-o066b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":238,"label":"十二月辛巳","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y238","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o059","basis":"十二月辛巳"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o066b-q","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o066b-q","source_order":[3,462,"O066b"],"order":960}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0054","name":"郭皇后（曹叡后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o050a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6dc749ac781a81d5a82f","layer":"original","quote":"帝疾困，遂立为皇后。齐王即位，尊后为皇太后，称“永宁宫”。追封谥太后父满，为西都定侯，以立子建绍其爵。封太后母杜，为郃阳君。芝迁散骑常侍、长水校尉；﹝一﹞立，宣德将军〖2〗；皆封列侯。建兄德，出养甄氏。德及建，俱为镇护将军〖3〗，皆封列侯，并掌宿卫。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o066b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-d18c5bf08a665a35694f","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，乙丑〖17〗，帝寝疾不豫〖18〗。辛巳〖19〗，立皇后〖20〗。赐天下男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独，谷。以燕王宇为大将军〖21〗；甲申免〖22〗，以武卫将军曹爽代之〖23〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
